    "message": "fake_server: engine pauses to reproduce INC-2291\n\n--pause-every S --pause-for P stops the whole engine for P seconds every\nS seconds: streams freeze and new requests wait, like the 1 s engine\npauses in INC-2291. Closed-loop p99 barely moves with them on. See the\nthread in #incidents; open-loop PR coming.",
