    "date": "2026-10-13T17:45:00-07:00",
    "message": "platform: precise asyncio timers on Windows (decision 0004)\n\nOn Windows + Python 3.12 the fake server's 8 ms token gaps came out as\n0 ms under load: asyncio's clock ticks every 15.6 ms there. _platform.run()\nraises the timer resolution and keeps loop time with perf_counter.\nTests and the CLI use it now. Thanks Ines for the review!",
